Reporting is controlled by \code{options(neuralsbi.progress = )}:
\itemize{
\item \code{"auto"} (default) -- report in interactive sessions, stay quiet in
scripts, \verb{R CMD check}, and knitr.
\item \code{TRUE} -- always report, interactive or not.
